---
source: src/scannerctl/linter/lints/script_xref_spacing.rs
expression: "$crate :: linter :: tests ::\nlint(& format! (\"{}.nasl\", stringify! (nested_expressions)),\n\"if (description) { if (TRUE) { script_xref(name:\\\"URL\\\", value:strcat(\\\"a, b\\\", \\\"c\\\")); } script_xref(name:\\\"URL\\\", value:\\\"x, y\\\"); }\",)"
---
error: Spaces after commas are not allowed in script_xref strings
  ┌─ nested_expressions.nasl:1:69
  │
1 │ if (description) { if (TRUE) { script_xref(name:"URL", value:strcat("a, b", "c")); } script_xref(name:"URL", value:"x, y"); }
  │                                                                     ^^^^^^ remove the space after the comma

